sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor Maintainer
    participant GH as GitHub Actions
    participant Guard as Tag guards
    participant GR as GoReleaser
    participant Release as GitHub Release

    Maintainer->>GH: Push approved vX.Y.Z tag
    GH->>Guard: Validate tag format
    Guard->>Guard: Fetch origin/master
    Guard->>Guard: Verify tag commit is in master history
    alt Invalid tag or ancestry
        Guard--xGH: Fail before publishing
        GH-->>Maintainer: Failed workflow
    else Valid release boundary
        Guard->>GR: Run pinned GoReleaser v2
        GR->>GR: Build 3 programs × 4 targets
        GR->>GR: Create 4 stable archives
        GR->>GR: Generate checksums.txt
        GR->>Release: Upload archives and checksums
        Release-->>Maintainer: Release assets available for inspection
    end

    Note over GH,GR: Pull-request CI uses snapshot mode and never publishes.
